(Japanese: '''ポケモンカード{{j|GB THE COMIX}}''' ''Pokémon Card GB The Comix'') is a one-shot [[Pokémon manga]] created by 姫野かげまる [[Kagemaru Himeno]]. It was published as part of the [[Pokémon Card GB Final Tactical Book]] strategy guide.

==Plot==
{{incomplete plot}}

==Major events==
* {{TCG GB|Mark}} and {{TCG GB|Ronald}} face each other in a two-Prize duel.
* Ronald defeats Mark's {{TCG ID|Jungle|Scyther|10}} with his {{TCG ID|Base Set|Dewgong|25}}, drawing one Prize.
* Mark defeats Ronald's {{TCG ID|Base Set|Dewgong|25}} with his {{TCG ID|Base Set|Ivysaur|30}}, drawing one Prize.
* Mark defeats Ronald's {{TCG ID|Fossil|Magmar|39}} with his {{TCG ID|Base Set|Charizard|4}}, drawing his final Prize and winning the duel.

